<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>DCBC - Dev Chhaya Badminton Club Rules</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cabinet+Grotesk:wght@800;900&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --court-green: #0a4d2e;
      --court-deep: #06311e;
      --court-surface: #0e5c37;
      --court-line: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
      --court-line-faint: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
      --gold: #f59e0b;
      --gold-light: #fbbf24;
      --text-main: #f0fdf4;
      --text-muted: #bbf7d0;
      --card-bg: rgba(6, 49, 30, 0.82);
      --card-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
      background-color: var(--court-deep);
      color: var(--text-main);
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      position: relative;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    /* Badminton Court Floor Grid Styling */
    .court-background {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 20%, #11683f 0%, var(--court-deep) 85%);
      z-index: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .court-grid {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 20px;
      border: 3px solid var(--court-line);
      border-radius: 8px;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .court-grid::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      left: 6%;
      right: 6%;
      border-left: 2px solid var(--court-line-faint);
      border-right: 2px solid var(--court-line-faint);
    }

    .court-center-line {
      position: absolute;
      top: 50%;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      height: 3px;
      background: var(--court-line);
      transform: translateY(-50%);
    }

    /* Huge DCBC Watermark */
    .watermark-container {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      z-index: 1;
      pointer-events: none;
      user-select: none;
    }

    .watermark-acronym {
      font-family: 'Cabinet Grotesk', sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(6rem, 24vw, 22rem);
      font-weight: 900;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      line-height: 0.9;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .watermark-sub {
      font-size: clamp(0.9rem, 2.2vw, 1.8rem);
      letter-spacing: 0.35em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.035);
      margin-top: 10px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    /* Main Container */
    .wrapper {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 960px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 40px 20px 80px;
    }

    /* Header */
    header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 44px;
    }

    .badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.15);
      border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.4);
      color: var(--gold-light);
      padding: 6px 16px;
      border-radius: 9999px;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-family: 'Cabinet Grotesk', sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.2rem);
      font-weight: 900;
      line-height: 1.15;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      color: #ffffff;
      text-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
    }

    .subtitle {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-top: 8px;
      max-width: 620px;
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
    }

    /* Rules Grid */
    .rules-list {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .rule-card {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
      backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 20px 24px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
      transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease, background 0.2s ease;
    }

    .rule-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);
      background: rgba(10, 68, 42, 0.9);
    }

    .rule-num {
      flex-shrink: 0;
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03));
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-family: 'Cabinet Grotesk', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      color: #ffffff;
    }

    .rule-content {
      flex: 1;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      color: var(--text-main);
      padding-top: 8px;
    }

    .rule-content strong {
      color: #ffffff;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .highlight-clause {
      color: var(--gold-light);
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    /* Tribute / Shout-out Banner */
    .shoutout-card {
      margin-top: 48px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.18), rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.08));
      border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.45);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 30px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 24px;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
    }

    .shoutout-icon {
      flex-shrink: 0;
      width: 60px;
      height: 60px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: var(--gold);
      color: #78350f;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 1.8rem;
    }

    .shoutout-text h2 {
      font-family: 'Cabinet Grotesk', sans-serif;
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--gold-light);
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .shoutout-text p {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      color: #ffffff;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    /* Footer */
    footer {
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 50px;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .wrapper {
        padding: 24px 16px 60px;
      }
      .rule-card {
        padding: 16px;
        gap: 14px;
      }
      .rule-num {
        width: 36px;
        height: 36px;
        font-size: 1.05rem;
      }
      .rule-content {
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        padding-top: 5px;
      }
      .shoutout-card {
        flex-direction: column;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 22px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- Court Background & Watermark Layer -->
  <div class="court-background">
    <div class="court-grid">
      <div class="court-center-line"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="watermark-container">
    <div class="watermark-acronym">DCBC</div>
    <div class="watermark-sub">Dev Chhaya Badminton Club</div>
  </div>

  <!-- Content Layer -->
  <div class="wrapper">
    <header>
      <div class="badge">🏸 Official Code of Play</div>
      <h1>Dev Chhaya Badminton Club</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">General club rules, match protocols, and court etiquette</p>
    </header>

    <main class="rules-list">
      <article class="rule-card">
        <div class="rule-num">1</div>
        <div class="rule-content">
          For being the member of the club one needs to pay the <strong>nominal membership fees</strong> whenever demanded by the committee.
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="rule-card">
        <div class="rule-num">2</div>
        <div class="rule-content">
          In case of any fight among the members, the membership fees <span class="highlight-clause">will not be refunded under any circumstances</span>.
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="rule-card">
        <div class="rule-num">3</div>
        <div class="rule-content">
          <strong>In/Out</strong> will be counted as per the spectators without requiring any appeal and will be a <strong>binding decision</strong>.
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="rule-card">
        <div class="rule-num">4</div>
        <div class="rule-content">
          <strong>Cut / Double / Net service</strong> should be appealed.
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="rule-card">
        <div class="rule-num">5</div>
        <div class="rule-content">
          Service should cross the short service line. (<span class="highlight-clause">On the line will be foul in service</span>).
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="rule-card">
        <div class="rule-num">6</div>
        <div class="rule-content">
          Every match should be of <strong>7 points each</strong>. If any members playing 11 points games will be mandated to continue till 7 points on request of any other member playing.
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="rule-card">
        <div class="rule-num">7</div>
        <div class="rule-content">
          Every member should wait for his turn to play. However, he can break the queue if the next team is inattentive.
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="rule-card">
        <div class="rule-num">8</div>
        <div class="rule-content">
          A member will have to wait for the present round to get complete if he comes late to play.
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="rule-card">
        <div class="rule-num">9</div>
        <div class="rule-content">
          A team can only be changed if <strong>ALL the members</strong> of both the teams agree.
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="rule-card">
        <div class="rule-num">10</div>
        <div class="rule-content">
          Members should avoid mobile phones while playing. <em>(Can be used for genuine cases)</em>.
        </div>
      </article>
    </main>

    <!-- Logistics Shout-Out -->
    <aside class="shoutout-card">
      <div class="shoutout-icon">👏</div>
      <div class="shoutout-text">
        <h2>Club Appreciation</h2>
        <p>Big shout-out to <strong>Pooja Jain</strong>, our official logistics manager, for bringing the racquets and the nets daily!</p>
      </div>
    </aside>

    <footer>
      &copy; Dev Chhaya Badminton Club (DCBC) &bull; Fair Play &amp; Sportsmanship
    </footer>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
